    "description": "Vintage labeled rock and mineral specimen set titled 'Specimens From The Desert'. Includes 24 individually labeled samples: Gold Ore, Lead/Silver, Copper, Manganese, Borax, Petrified Wood, Sulphur, Porphyry, Marble, Hematite, Calcite, Epidote, Actinolite, Obsidian, Lepidolite, Anthophyllite, Dumortierite, Opalite, Pyrite, Thulite, Quartz, Banite, Jasper, and Serpentine. Specimens measure approximately 1-2 inches and are mounted within a cardboard display box with handwritten labels. Box shows visible wear on the exterior; interior and specimens are well-preserved and clearly labeled. Suitable for collectors, geology enthusiasts, or educational use.",
