    "description": "Unbranded\nSilver-Tone Metal Smoking Pipe\nTraditional Asian Style, Vintage\nThis ornate smoking pipe features intricate silver-tone wirework and filigree decoration throughout the bowl and stem. The design incorporates traditional Asian motifs, including butterfly-like forms and floral appliques, characteristic of Miao or Hmong metalwork traditions. The elongated, curved stem is segmented by decorative bands and applied filigree, leading to a small, structured bowl area with scrolled wire details and a hanging decorative element.\nSilver-tone metal construction with hand-applied filigree and wirework decoration\nTraditional Asian design featuring butterfly and floral motifs characteristic of regional metalwork\nElongated curved stem with segmented decorative bands and ring-turned finials\nDimensions: 8.5\" H x 3\" W x 1\" L\nCondition:\nGood vintage condition with significant natural patina and surface oxidation throughout, giving the metal a yellowish-green hue. No structural breaks or missing filigree elements are apparent. The mouthpiece and bowl opening show expected darkening from age and handling. The metal surfaces remain intact with no evidence of repair or structural damage.\nAll items are sold as-is. Condition, completeness, and functionality may vary. Items may not be fully tested, authenticated, sorted, or inventoried unless explicitly stated in the listing. For bulk, lot, or miscellaneous listings, contents can include a mix of brands, types, and conditions, and there are no guarantees regarding specific items included.\nAutographs and signatures have not been authenticated unless otherwise noted.\nWatches and electronics may not be tested for full functionality and may only be tested for power on, if at all.\nDue to the nature of these items, no returns or refunds will be accepted for condition, completeness, or functionality. Buyers are responsible for reviewing all photos and descriptions and must address any questions or concerns prior to bidding or purchase. By placing a bid or completing a purchase, you agree to these terms.\nFor jewelry orders only:\nCombined shipping is available for multiple items but must be requested through customer service prior to completing payment. This process is not automatic, and no refunds will be issued for combined shipping after payment has been processed.\nPlease note:\nWhat is pictured is what is in the box/bag. As this is an assorted bulk jewelry items, there are no guarantees in regards to the items included and condition. This will contain some combination of mismatched, damaged, craft/costume jewelry, and accessories. Note that the auctions are typically shipped in bulk and not packaged individually. This auction is not available for closer examination or additional information or pictures beyond what has been disclosed. Coin lots have been sorted as to not contain any US coins or currency or non-monetary items. However, a few may be missed and could be included.\nNo returns or refunds will be accepted for this auction. By placing a bid on this auction, you accept this as a condition of the sale.\nOversized Prints, Paintings & Framed Artwork – Shipping Disclaimer\nSome oversized prints, paintings, and framed artwork may be listed as",
